{"id":"n70783-1-8","stage":1,"title":"들리다 · 听到","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70783-1-8-1","ko":"제가 잘못한 게 도대체 뭐죠?","zh":"我到底做错了什么啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못한","meaning":"做错，做得不好","explanation":"잘못하다：做错，做得不好；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잘못하다","audio":"/audio/c088e8817916a36c7669.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69936","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못한","audio":"/audio/a2e10970e7724192ee9d.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"도대체","meaning":"到底，究竟","explanation":"도대체：到底，究竟","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"3","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐죠?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐죠","audio":"/audio/0a7b1067d67ec87b4c35.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"